{"2275920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Energy Fighters", "steam_appid": 2275920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energy Fighters is a fast-paced side-scrolling arcade shooter built around reactive combat, polarity-based survival, and tactical counterattacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy fire is not always a threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your ship’s polarity shield to absorb matching enemy attacks, restore health, traverse dangerous energy barriers, and turn overwhelming assaults into opportunities for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deflect incoming projectiles, manage enemy pressure from multiple directions, and unleash devastating firepower as the battlefield descends into chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275920/extras/859a34e1bcfa1e96f097ccef6bec6cc7.poster.avif?t=1779877549\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275920/extras/859a34e1bcfa1e96f097ccef6bec6cc7.webm?t=1779877549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275920/extras/859a34e1bcfa1e96f097ccef6bec6cc7.mp4?t=1779877549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reactive Polarity Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energy Fighters transforms enemy attacks into a core part of the gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matching enemy fire with your current polarity allows you to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Absorb incoming projectiles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recover lost health</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Safely pass through matching energy barriers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive overwhelming enemy assaults</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create opportunities for aggressive counterattacks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choosing the wrong polarity at the wrong moment can quickly become fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275920/extras/3d20a67dc4578e72aeeccff27828cab8.poster.avif?t=1779877549\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275920/extras/3d20a67dc4578e72aeeccff27828cab8.webm?t=1779877549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275920/extras/3d20a67dc4578e72aeeccff27828cab8.mp4?t=1779877549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical Counterattack Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival depends on far more than simple dodging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must constantly react to rapidly changing combat situations while balancing:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offensive positioning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defensive shielding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy projectile management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Front and rear attack directions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split-second polarity decisions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As enemy attacks intensify, maintaining control becomes increasingly difficult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275920/extras/28deee338cfc7b8db37172a49cfb4488.poster.avif?t=1779877549\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275920/extras/28deee338cfc7b8db37172a49cfb4488.webm?t=1779877549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275920/extras/28deee338cfc7b8db37172a49cfb4488.mp4?t=1779877549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deflect Enemy Fire</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfectly timed defensive play allows players to deflect incoming enemy projectiles back toward enemy forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn enemy fire into a weapon:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Redirect attacks toward hostile targets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear dangerous combat zones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create openings during intense enemy pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain defensive reactions into devastating counterattacks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering deflection mechanics becomes essential for survival during later stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275920/extras/73cf5b8e7fabd804e6784a652042fd6d.poster.avif?t=1779877549\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275920/extras/73cf5b8e7fabd804e6784a652042fd6d.webm?t=1779877549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275920/extras/73cf5b8e7fabd804e6784a652042fd6d.mp4?t=1779877549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique polarity-based combat system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Absorb matching enemy projectiles to survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deflect incoming attacks back at enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Front and rear directional weapon systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse dangerous energy barriers using matching polarity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced side-scrolling arcade gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense enemy waves and escalating combat pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosive boss encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local co-op multiplayer support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic arcade-inspired sci-fi action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill-based gameplay focused on reaction speed and tactical awareness</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Co-op Combat Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight alongside another player in local co-op and survive increasingly chaotic battlefield encounters together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate defensive shielding, manage enemy pressure from multiple directions, and support each other during overwhelming combat situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op transforms every battle into a frantic test of teamwork, positioning, and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275920/extras/2db956e4f9053a608a68281d0c3020fc.poster.avif?t=1779877549\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275920/extras/2db956e4f9053a608a68281d0c3020fc.webm?t=1779877549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275920/extras/2db956e4f9053a608a68281d0c3020fc.mp4?t=1779877549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overwhelming Enemy Pressure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energy Fighters is built around constant combat escalation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy waves become larger, projectile patterns more dangerous, and reaction windows increasingly unforgiving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success requires:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rapid decision making</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precise movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical shielding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Efficient counterattacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete battlefield awareness</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One mistake can quickly spiral into total chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn Enemy Fire Against Them</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energy Fighters combines classic arcade shooter intensity with modern reactive combat mechanics built around absorption, deflection, and polarity management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive impossible odds, master defensive counterplay, and transform enemy attacks into your greatest weapon.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energy Fighters is a fast-paced side-scrolling arcade shooter built around reactive combat, polarity-based survival, and tactical counterattacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy fire is not always a threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your ship’s polarity shield to absorb matching enemy attacks, restore health, traverse dangerous energy barriers, and turn overwhelming assaults into opportunities for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deflect incoming projectiles, manage enemy pressure from multiple directions, and unleash devastating firepower as the battlefield descends into chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2275920/extras/859a34e1bcfa1e96f097ccef6bec6cc7.poster.avif?t=1779877549\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"ht